{"id":"8251569340490","handle":"plus-size-knot-detail-high-low-wedding-guest-dress-eg02824","title":"Plus Size Knot Detail High Low Wedding Guest Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>Celebrate in style with this elegant plus-size wedding guest dress! Featuring a chic knot detail and crafted from soft crepe fabric, this dress offers a flattering fit and timeless sophistication. Perfect for weddings, formal events, or any special occasion!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><span>Tips:</span> Made of high-stretch fabric with at least 2 inches of stretch.</strong><br /><strong>Select your size based on the standard size chart.</strong><br /><strong>If there is a significant difference between your bust, waist, and hip measurements, prioritize the bust measurement when choosing.</strong><br /><strong>For a tighter fit, please choose one size smaller.</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: High low.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Cap sleeve.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Back zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: It is not padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises crepe.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is high stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Wedding Guest Dresses","tags":["A-Line","Cap Sleeve","Crepe Dresses","Dresses","Fall","High Low","influencer-picks","Knotted","measure","New Arrivals","Plus Size Dresses","Round Neckline","See-through","Sequin","Short Sleeves","Spring","Summer","The Wedding Shop","Wedding Guest Dresses","Winters","With Sleeves"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.ever-pretty.com/products/plus-size-knot-detail-high-low-wedding-guest-dress-eg02824","capturedAt":"2026-09-30T00:40:08.678Z","price":{"amount":64.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"options":["Color","Size"],"variants":[{"id":"43730950619210","sku":"EG02824DG16","color":"Dark Green","size":"16","options":["Dark Green","16"],"price"